Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 14:54:32 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] feat(jira): download attachments to server disk with
 strict validation

- add download_attachment_strict(): no redirect following (Jira Server/DC
  redirects unauthenticated /secure/attachment requests to the login page),
  reject HTML login pages, verify byte count against Jira metadata, atomic
  .part -> replace
- download_issue_attachments(): add pattern/overwrite, sha256, skipped list,
  success reflects partial failures
- expose jira_download_attachments_to_disk MCP tool (toolset: jira_attachments)
  so large attachments stay on disk instead of being inlined as base64
- tests: strict paths (redirect / login page / size mismatch / ok)
